    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are proud to present this superb one-bedroom, one-bathroom apartment to the Dublin 2 property market. Perfectly positioned in the heart of the prestigious Grand Canal Dock in the highly sought-after Hanover Riverside development, No. 83 comes to the market in turn-key condition. \n\nThe location of Hanover Riverside is simply world-class. Situated in the heart of Dublin's 'Silicon Docks,' you are surrounded by global tech giants, luxury hotels, and the iconic Bord Gáis Energy Theatre. A short, scenic stroll along the Liffey brings you directly into the city centre, with St. Stephen's Green and Grafton Street within easy reach. The area is exceptionally well-serviced by transport links, including the Pearse Street DART station and the Luas at Mayor Square, offering unparalleled connectivity for any urban professional.\n\nInternal living accommodation of c. 55 sq m is exceptionally bright and airy, designed with luxury and space in mind. Upon entering, you are greeted by a welcoming hallway with generous storage that leads into a stunning, open-plan living and dining area. The property benefits from underground heating and floor-to-ceiling glazing that floods the space with natural light and opens onto a nice private back terrace an ideal, quiet spot for outdoor relaxation away from the hustle and bustle of the city. The contemporary kitchen is finished to a high standard with integrated appliances and premium countertops.\n\nThe sleeping quarters consist of a large, well-proportioned double bedroom featuring high-quality flooring and large floor to ceiling windows with fitted blinds. The accommodation is completed by a high-spec, modern family bathroom finished with luxury tiling and fittings. With secure designated parking and beautifully maintained communal courtyards, 83 Hanover Riverside offers the ultimate in sophisticated city living for those seeking a premium one-bedroom residence in Dublin 2.\n\nEarly viewing is highly advised. Call RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS today!\n\nFeatures\nc. 55 sq. m.\nBER C3\nUnderfloor heating throughout\nPrivate back terrace\nStunning condition throughout\nOne large double bedroom / One bathroom\nPrime Grand Canal Dock location\nFloor-to-ceiling glazing\nHigh-spec contemporary kitchen\nWalking distance to city centre and DART\nViewing highly advised!\nPerfect for first time buyers and investors alike\n\nDirections:\nExiting the M50 at Junction 9 (Red Cow), follow the N7/R110 citybound along the Naas Road and through Dolphin's Barn onto the Grand Canal bank. Continue along the South Canal Road (R111) until you reach Grand Canal Dock, then turn left onto Forbes Street and right onto Hanover Quay. Take the next right onto Asgard Road Click to open side panel for more information , and the entrance to Hanover Riverside will be on your left-hand side."
      },
      {
